Bugs fixed across three modules:

- **`src/auth.py`**
  - `has_permission` now compares roles case-insensitively (`role.lower() == required.lower()`).
  - `is_admin_or_owner` changed from `and` to `or` so either admin role or matching owner ID grants access.

- **`src/inventory.py`**
  - `__init__` no longer uses a mutable default dict (`initial=None` and copies it).
  - `add` now accumulates stock (`+=`) instead of overwriting.
  - `reserve` allows reserving exactly the available amount (`>` instead of `>=`).
  - `release` raises `ValueError` when trying to release more than is reserved.

- **`src/text_utils.py`**
  - `slugify` lowercases alphanumeric characters and collapses consecutive separators to a single hyphen.
  - `truncate` accounts for the suffix length so the final string stays within `max_len`.
